== Canonical public versus BITwiki-internal separation ==

Public pages use unsuffixed Main titles:

<pre>
Evidence
Uncertainty
Epistemic status
Provenance
Validation
</pre>

BITwiki project machinery remains explicitly namespaced:

<pre>
BITwiki:Evidence
BITwiki:Uncertainty
BITwiki:Epistemic status
BITwiki:Provenance
BITwiki:Claim validation
</pre>

The public page may link to the project page only in an "Application in BITwiki" subsection when useful. Project policy must never be presented as the universal definition.

